{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは(o^∀^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/05/21/0279542/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGO!4応援企画。\n告知出来てなくてすみません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２期生も応援されたいと言う事で\n私は能條さんに応援して\nもらいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく恥ずかしかった...\nまだ見てない方は見てね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........................................."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/05/21/0279542/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岩盤浴に行ってきました。\n温泉が好きなので何かあれば\n家族で温泉に行ったりしてます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お風呂上がりのあのアイスね、\nたまらんね(((^-^)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が落ち着く場所best3は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3位 スターバックスコーヒー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理由:色合い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2位 ドラッグストア、雑貨屋さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理由:いろいろな物が売っていて\n見てて楽しくなる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1位 本屋さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理由:種類がたくさんあって飽きない\n暇さえあればほとんど通ってる〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに4位が温泉です。\nなんでいきなりこんな話になったか\nと言うと特に理由はありません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと言ってみたかっただけです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/